    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      450.67,
      542.71,
      463.63
    ],
    "text": "The Applicant\u2013Respondent-Respondent (hereinafter sometimes referred to as the",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Light"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      470.47,
      542.79,
      483.43
    ],
    "text": "\u201cRespondent\u201d) the Divisional Secretary had instituted the ejectment proceedings in",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Light"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      490.39,
      542.82,
      503.35
    ],
    "text": "respect of the land described in the application filed in the Magistrate\u2019s Court under",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Light"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      510.19,
      542.92,
      523.15
    ],
    "text": "section 5 of the Act (at page 26 of the brief). The Appellant had maintained that he and",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Light"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      529.99,
      542.46,
      542.95
    ],
    "text": "his predecessor had occupied the land since 1980 and that his predecessor had been",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Light"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      549.79,
      543.01,
      562.75
    ],
    "text": "issued a document which the Appellant described as a \u201clicense\u201d. The Appellant further",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Light",
      "Calibri-LightItalic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      569.71,
      542.52,
      582.67
    ],
    "text": "state that officers responsible for State lands had directed or recommended the issue of",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Light"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      589.51,
      542.52,
      602.47
    ],
    "text": "a license to him and that he had obtained water and electricity connections and made",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Light"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      609.34,
      212.02,
      622.3
    ],
    "text": "improvement to the land.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Light"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      637.18,
      542.54,
      650.14
    ],
    "text": "In accordance with the procedure under the Act, the learned Magistrate had afforded the",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Light"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      657.1,
      542.54,
      670.06
    ],
    "text": "Appellant an opportunity to show cause against ejectment. The Respondent had been",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Light"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      676.9,
      542.6,
      689.86
    ],
    "text": "permitted to file counter-objections, and both parties had been given an opportunity to",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Light"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      696.7,
      542.62,
      709.66
    ],
    "text": "tender written submissions. The Appellant had based his claim on two documents",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Light"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      728.96,
      543.1,
      756.05
    ],
    "text": "4",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      51.21,
      543.01,
      66.0
    ],
    "text": "submitted by him, marked \u0dc01 and \u0dc02. The learned Magistrate rejected document \u0dc01,",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Light",
      "IskoolaPota"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      71.01,
      542.95,
      85.8
    ],
    "text": "being an expired permit issued to a lady named Alice Nona, and document \u0dc02, being an",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Light",
      "IskoolaPota"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      92.78,
      542.46,
      105.74
    ],
    "text": "agreement, as not amounting to a valid permit or other written authority of the State as",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Light"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      112.58,
      542.76,
      125.54
    ],
    "text": "envisaged by section 9 of the Act. Having considered the material placed before Court,",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Light"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      132.38,
      522.87,
      145.34
    ],
    "text": "the learned Magistrate had made order ejecting the Appellant from the relevant land.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Light"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      166.22,
      542.94,
      252.26
    ],
    "text": "Being aggrieved by the order of the learned Magistrate, the Appellant invoked the revisionary jurisdiction of the High Court. The learned High Court Judge dismissed the revision application at the stage of support, without issuing notice to the Respondents by the order dated 22.03.2018. The Appellant being dissatisfied with the order of the High Court has filed the instant appeal to this Court.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Light"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      281.45,
      172.51,
      294.41
    ],
    "text": "Grounds of Appeal",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Light"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      305.81,
      542.55,
      318.77
    ],
    "text": "The instant appeal challenges the High Court's treatment of the documents, the",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Light"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      325.61,
      542.52,
      338.57
    ],
    "text": "identification of the land, the conclusion that the Appellant's occupation was",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Light"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      345.41,
      542.32,
      358.37
    ],
    "text": "unauthorized, and its failure to give effect to what the Appellant describes as a legitimate",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Light"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      365.33,
      542.51,
      378.29
    ],
    "text": "expectation arising from the conduct and correspondence of land officials. The written",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Light"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      385.13,
      542.39,
      398.09
    ],
    "text": "submissions add objections to the Divisional Secretary's authority to institute the",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Light"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      404.93,
      542.43,
      417.89
    ],
    "text": "proceedings and to the form of the application and supporting affidavit. The central",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Light"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      424.75,
      542.41,
      437.71
    ],
    "text": "question is whether these matters disclose an error in the High Court's refusal to revise",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Light"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      444.67,
      183.79,
      457.63
    ],
    "text": "the ejectment order.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Light"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      488.47,
      183.91,
      501.43
    ],
    "text": "Statutory framework",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri-Light"
    ],
    "sizes": [
