  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      658.42,
      542.61,
      689.62
    ],
    "text": "The petition of appeal does not expressly identify any exceptional circumstance warranting the exercise of revisionary jurisdiction. It alleges errors in the Magistrate\u2019s",
